cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EVoyage in academic work or in a product, please cite it as below."
title: EVoyage
abstract: >-
  EVoyage is an electric-vehicle route planner that treats waiting time at charging
  stations as a first-class routing cost. It folds day-by-hour occupancy priors into the
  shortest-path search over OpenStreetMap-derived regional graphs, and ships a
  self-contained C++23 routing and guidance engine with a Go + HTMX web front-end.
type: software
